 mechanics based on the character's contamination level.<br></li><li> A lot of exploration, similar to the &quot;Souls&quot; game series! Find every secret corner of every location to understand what happened to the world.<br></li><li> The game is driven by its visual narrative.<br></li><li> A meta-narrative hidden inside the main story. Maybe this game is not about robots and disease at all...</li></ul><br><i>The lonely robot, he has no plans<br>His faith and soul is in your hands. </i><br><br>68 6f 72 6e 20 77 61 6b 65 73 20 75 70<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/645290/extras/130f8e353a64edc0e06fb09ff02e5309.poster.avif?t=1569345629\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/645290/extras/130f8e353a64edc0e06fb09ff02e5309.webm?t=1569345629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/645290/extras/130f8e353a64edc0e06fb09ff02e5309.mp4?t=1569345629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong> This game was created by only one person, whose name is Alexander Khoroshavin, with his family and friends' support. </strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/645290/extras/e9fff3cc65923799ed32bfc6fc6b64b7.poster.avif?t=1569345629\" width=598 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/645290/extras/e9fff3cc65923799ed32bfc6fc6b64b7.webm?t=1569345629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/645290/extras/e9fff3cc65923799ed32bfc6fc6b64b7.mp4?t=1569345629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
